      "created_at": "2023-07-30T14:03:16.626Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Don’t expect them to, since the game’s already published and it seems very unlikely they’ll make any more of it beyond the one expansion. Handelabra is here to adapt, not change!</p>\n<p>Though feeling there’s something missing is, in my mind, totally valid. I like SOEP, but I’ll also admit it’s just… not the same experience as playing SOTM.</p>",
