      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-07-30T20:40:31.593Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The art is sourced by people contracted by Green Ronin and the mechanics were done by GTG.  Since it’s not an IP Christopher controls he was given stuff to go off but not his own lore to go off.   Additionally no idea of what final art might be like which he usually got with Adam.   Lastly, the mechanics were done right after OblivAeon was finished and Christopher has mentioned his head wasn’t quite in the right place.   However, it needed done as OblivAeon had delayed his work on it.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2023-07-30T20:40:31.593Z",
