      "created_at": "2023-07-31T20:39:52.602Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Feels like a prototype for a few DE changes. I never really bought into that particular IP, so it’s… yeah, it’s fine. Daedalus and Lady Liberty are cool, couple others are interesting, but the villains are… meh. Maybe that last bit is because I got sick of the “Evil Hades” trope a LOOOOOOOONG time ago…</p>",
