      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2025-09-17T11:28:08.662Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I honestly wish I cared more.  I have to scroll past inactive SOEP decks every time I want to play Cauldron (which at this point is more often than I want to play a pure SOTM game, though I never do more than Cauldron Villain OR Environment).  One or two of them look vaguely interesting, but… the art style is just SO generic.  I’d say it looks like AI, but honestly AI art is way better, this is like prototype AI from 2021.  There’s no soul in virtually all the images I’ve seen.</p>",
