      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2025-09-17T13:37:44.643Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Talked to Chris Pramas about it at Gen Con a couple years ago, and yeah. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=12\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> They also had issues with the individual artists just ghosting them, so the company they went through for art was constantly having to ramp up new artists and get them acclimated to the house style before they could even be productive. That entire process did <strong>not</strong> go the way they would have preferred… <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/pensive.png?v=12\" title=\":pensive:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":pensive:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
